config BR2_PACKAGE_LVGL
	bool "lvgl"
	help
	  Light and Versatile Graphics Library 9.6.

	  TinyOS uses the MIT-licensed LVGL 9.6 renderer with a static
	  configuration generated from config/lv_conf.h. The library is
	  built as a static archive and linked directly into the TinyOS
	  binary; no runtime configuration files are needed.

	  https://lvgl.io/
